cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite it as below."
title: "Alt-Protein Sales Effects: models, estimates and figures"
abstract: >-
  Bayesian multilevel models estimating the effect of introducing plant-based
  analogs on meat and animal-based purchases across restaurants, with the
  figures and tables built from the fitted posteriors. Consumes the modelling
  dataset produced by the restaurant-sales pipeline.
type: software
authors:
